{"id":"en_fighting-for-her","title":"Fighting For Her","titleEn":"Fighting For Her","description":"A former boxing champion returns to the underground circuit after taking a bullet meant for her coach. Her world shatters when her girlfriend is shot in her place, and something in her gives way. Cutting ties with everyone around her, she enters the cage to confront the king of the underground, a man convinced she is already broken. What he fails to see is that she has become something else entirely, a phantom he cannot read. The story follows her descent into a ruthless fight world where loss and vengeance blur together. Fighting For Her and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fighting-for-her/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fighting-for-her/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Modern Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dodn8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fighting-for-her_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dodn8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fighting-for-her_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dodn8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fighting-for-her_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dodn8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fighting-for-her_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dodn8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed